<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Steam on DjangoZane</title><link>https://blog.djangozane.com/tags/steam/</link><description>Recent content in Steam on DjangoZane</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-Hans</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 02:16:36 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.djangozane.com/tags/steam/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>最近在玩的一些游戏推荐</title><link>https://blog.djangozane.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E8%BF%91%E5%9C%A8%E7%8E%A9%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90/</link><pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 02:16:36 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.djangozane.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E8%BF%91%E5%9C%A8%E7%8E%A9%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在好几年前某一次 Steam 促销的时候，买了一个 &lt;a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/1942280/Brotato/"&gt;土豆兄弟&lt;/a&gt;，但是当时一直玩不来这类游戏，所以玩了没几个小时就卸载闲置了，直到最近在忙碌的工作间隙突然想玩点游戏休息一下。唯一的一个要求就是不能太耗时间，并且能够想停就停。然后就在游戏库存里又翻到了土豆兄弟。&lt;/p&gt;
